# 基本図形編集の格子点 (design 11.3), for tools/ui_run.py: the desktop's figure editor and the
# process. A figure of one rectangle and two lines (mkbig fig 1 2 0) is opened at 100,100 as
# 画用紙 is; the figure's 0,0 is drawn at 110,128 of the screen, so with the grid at its 16
# a point of it is at 446,448 and none at 447,448. The 格子点 palette comes up under its
# button (366,48) at 350,68: 表示モード なし at 499,86, 表示のみ at 579,86, 格子点拘束 at
# 683,86. Chosen, the grid is drawn over the whole figure at once, while the palette is up
# and after it is put away; なし takes it off the whole figure again. With 格子点拘束 a
# rectangle drawn from 455,457 to 603,565 is put on the grid (352,336 to 496,432), carried
# by 51,45 it goes 48,48 (its corner at 400,384), and sized by its corner by 33,21 its
# corner goes to 576,496. Saved, record 0 is the same from both, byte for byte.
# Keys: Esc 29; Ctrl+S 16 01, Ctrl+E 08 01.
figproc kernel
mkbig fig 1 2 0
open big
waitwin 画用紙 600
sync 600
wait 500
pixel 446 448 FFFFFF
click 366 48
wait 500
click 579 86
wait 400
pixel 446 448 808080
pixel 447 448 FFFFFF
pixel 798 640 808080
key 29
wait 400
pixel 446 448 808080
pixel 798 640 808080
click 366 48
wait 500
click 499 86
wait 400
pixel 446 448 FFFFFF
pixel 798 640 FFFFFF
key 29
wait 400
pixel 446 448 FFFFFF
click 366 48
wait 500
click 683 86
wait 400
pixel 446 448 808080
key 29
wait 400
pixel 798 640 808080
click 298 82
wait 300
drag 455 457 603 565
wait 400
click 298 48
wait 300
drag 520 500 571 545
sync 600
wait 300
drag 654 608 687 629
sync 600
wait 300
shot grid_k_done
key 16 01
sync 600
sum show
keep kernel
key 08 01
sync 600
wait 500
mkbig fig 1 2 0
logmark
pfig big
expectsincein 60 figure: opened 画用紙 shapes 3
wait 800
pixel 446 448 FFFFFF
logmark
click 366 48
expectsince figure: palette 7 open
wait 500
click 579 86
wait 400
pixel 446 448 808080
pixel 447 448 FFFFFF
pixel 798 640 808080
key 29
expectsince figure: palette 7 closed
wait 400
pixel 446 448 808080
pixel 798 640 808080
logmark
click 366 48
expectsince figure: palette 7 open
wait 500
click 499 86
wait 400
pixel 446 448 FFFFFF
pixel 798 640 FFFFFF
key 29
expectsince figure: palette 7 closed
wait 400
pixel 446 448 FFFFFF
logmark
click 366 48
expectsince figure: palette 7 open
wait 500
click 683 86
wait 400
pixel 446 448 808080
key 29
expectsince figure: palette 7 closed
wait 400
pixel 798 640 808080
logmark
click 298 82
expectsince figure: tool 7
drag 455 457 603 565
expectsince figure: drawn
logmark
click 298 48
wait 300
drag 520 500 571 545
expectsince figure: moved 1 by 48,48
logmark
drag 654 608 687 629
expectsince figure: sized 3 to 176x112
wait 300
shot grid_p_done
key 16 01
sync 600
sum show
same kernel
